Package: ai-tabs
Version: {{VERSION}}
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nodejs (>= 18.0.0) | node (>= 18.0.0), git, npm
Maintainer: Servosity <support@servosity.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Servosity/ai-tabs
Description: Browser-based tab manager for AI coding-agent terminals
 ai-tabs provides a tabbed browser interface for managing multiple
 AI coding-agent terminal sessions (Claude Code, Codex CLI, Gemini CLI).
 It runs a local web server and opens a browser window with tab
 management capabilities.
